  "verdict": "REQUIRES HUMAN REVIEW",
  "summary": "This plan replaces the production API load balancer to add a third subnet. The replacement causes downtime while the new load balancer is provisioned and DNS propagates. The new security group opening 80/443 to the internet is appropriate for a public API. Confirm that the load balancer replacement strategy and expected downtime are acceptable.",
  "rules": ["R3", "R6"],
